# The Chrome extension is tracked HERE. It was excluded on the theory that it lived in its own
# repo, but nothing was ever pushed there, so a day of fixes — the registration bug, the tab
# storm, the activity log — existed only on one laptop with no history. Worse, the test that
# guards the registration fix skips itself when this folder is missing, so a fresh clone passed
# by not running it. The two halves are edited together and are useless apart; keep them together.
luma-icp-scout/**/__pycache__/
luma-icp-scout/**/.DS_Store
luma-icp-scout-*.zip

# SQLite side-files
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Your own identifiers, enforced by tests/test_no_private_data.py, never committed.
tests/private-denylist.txt
warmgraph.db
warmgraph.db-wal
warmgraph.db-shm

# Your own ICP. Copy config/icp.example.json to config/icp.json and edit it.
config/icp.json
